flowchart LR
  DEV[Codex branch] --> PR[PR + CI lint types tests]
  PR --> QA{All gates passed?}
  QA -->|no| FIX[Fix without hiding failure]
  FIX --> PR
  QA -->|yes| STAGE[Staging deploy on approval]
  STAGE --> E2E[Real host + TLS + user smoke]
  E2E --> GATE{Human approval to prod?}
  GATE -->|no| STANDBY[Blocked external / checkpoint]
  GATE -->|yes| BACKUP[D1 checkpoint / R2 inventory]
  BACKUP --> DEPLOY[Production release]
  DEPLOY --> SMOKE[Post-deploy smoke + observability]
  SMOKE --> FAIL{Critical incident?}
  FAIL -->|yes| ROLLBACK[Rollback code + recover data by plan]
  FAIL -->|no| DONE[Release documented]
